{"id":"n93453-1-11","stage":5,"title":"암기력 · 记忆力","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n93453-1-11-1","ko":"저 건강식품을 먹으면 암기력이 좋아진대.","zh":"据说吃那种健康食品的话，记忆力会变好哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"건강식품을","meaning":"保健食品，健康食品","explanation":"건강식품：保健食品，健康食品；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"건강식품","audio":"/audio/ce81c4a41f32becf0e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"21626","senseId":"1","lemma":"건강식품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건강식품을","audio":"/audio/71b15fffa7e5d7e99fad.mp3"}},{"text":"먹으면","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹으면","audio":"/audio/739522170380acf8cc3e.mp3"}},{"text":"암기력이","meaning":"记忆力","explanation":"암기력：记忆力；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"암기력","audio":"/audio/fef7873c0b389f9d2d34.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"93453","senseId":"1","lemma":"암기력","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"암기력이","audio":"/audio/d67ecdd631bde70eaeb1.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아진대.","meaning":"好，有益，有效；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"좋다：好，有益，有效；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；ㄴ대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"14","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아진대","audio":"/audio/ef12bf728cd0284ca